{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/344","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/344/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/344/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/344/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/344","id":5139940063,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABMl1C3w","number":344,"title":"9 hydrate labels state a hydration number with no known corresponding hydrate","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-13T09:37:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T03:33:45Z","closed_at":"2026-09-12T03:33:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Found during the adversarial review of #341, by checking each label's stated hydration number against the known stable hydrates of that salt.\n\n| record label | stated n | known hydrates |\n|---|---|---|\n| `CaCl2 x 7 H2O` | 7 | 1, 2, 4, 6 |\n| `CuCl2 x 6 H2O` | 6 | 2 |\n| `FeCl2 x 6 H2O` | 6 | 2, 4 |\n| `FeCl2 x 7 H2O` | 7 | 2, 4 |\n| `FeCl3 x 4 H2O` | 4 | 6 |\n| `MgCl2 x 7 H2O` | 7 | 6 |\n| `Na2HPO4 x 3 H2O` | 3 | 2, 7, 8, 12 |\n| `Na2HPO4 x 6 H2O` | 6 | 2, 7, 8, 12 |\n| `NiCl2 x 5 H2O` | 5 | 2, 4, 6 |\n\n10 of the 19 checked do match a known hydrate, so this is not a systematic notation problem — it is 9 specific labels.\n\n## The pattern worth chasing first\n\n`MgCl2 x 7 H2O` and `FeCl2 x 7 H2O` stand out: **`MgSO4·7H2O` and `FeSO4·7H2O` are among the most common salts in microbial growth media**, and both are genuine heptahydrates. A sulfate → chloride slip somewhere upstream would produce exactly these two labels. Worth checking the source rows before assuming the hydration number is what's wrong — it may be the anion.\n\nNote MIM already holds separate `FeSO4 x 7 H2O` records (`CHEBI:75832`/`CHEBI:75836` appear as a same-name-different-identifier pair in the duplicate report), so a comparison against those recipes is possible.\n\n## Relationship to #341\n\n#341 corrected these records' `molecular_formula` from the anhydrous salt's to one that includes the stated water, so for these 9 the formula now faithfully encodes a hydration number that may not correspond to a real substance. That is **not a regression** — the previous value (the anhydrous formula) was wrong for every hydrate — but it does mean the formula is only as good as the label, and these 9 labels are in question.\n\nResolving this needs the upstream source rows (MediaDive / CultureBotHT / the original recipe text), not chemistry reasoning, so it was filed rather than guessed at.","closed_by":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/344/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/344/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}